---
/** Programación clásica vs machine learning. */
---
<figure class="diagram not-content">
	<svg viewBox="0 0 760 210" role="img" aria-label="Programación clásica frente a machine learning">
		<defs>
			<marker id="pa" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0,0L10,5L0,10z" fill="var(--sl-color-gray-3)" /></marker>
		</defs>
		<text x="175" y="22" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b">Programación clásica</text>
		<rect x="20" y="45" width="90" height="40" rx="10" class="box-o" /><text x="65" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Reglas</text>
		<rect x="20" y="120" width="90" height="40" rx="10" class="box" /><text x="65" y="145" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Datos</text>
		<rect x="150" y="80" width="100" height="50" rx="12" class="box-v" /><text x="200" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b">Computador</text>
		<rect x="290" y="85" width="90" height="40" rx="10" class="box-a" /><text x="335" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Respuestas</text>
		<path d="M110,65 L150,95" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" /><path d="M110,140 L150,118" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" /><path d="M250,105 L288,105" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" />
		<line x1="400" y1="20" x2="400" y2="190" class="ln" stroke-dasharray="4 5" />
		<text x="585" y="22" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b">Machine learning</text>
		<rect x="420" y="45" width="90" height="40" rx="10" class="box" /><text x="465" y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Datos</text>
		<rect x="420" y="120" width="90" height="40" rx="10" class="box-a" /><text x="465" y="145" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Respuestas</text>
		<rect x="550" y="80" width="100" height="50" rx="12" class="box-v" /><text x="600" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b">Algoritmo de</text><text x="600" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b">aprendizaje</text>
		<rect x="680" y="85" width="70" height="40" rx="10" class="box-o" /><text x="715" y="103" text-anchor="middle" class="t">Reglas</text><text x="715" y="117" text-anchor="middle" class="t-s">(modelo)</text>
		<path d="M510,65 L550,95" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" /><path d="M510,140 L550,118" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" /><path d="M650,105 L678,105" class="ln" marker-end="url(#pa)" />
	</svg>
	<figcaption>Clásica: reglas + datos → respuestas. ML: datos + respuestas → reglas (el modelo). No sabemos escribir las reglas para «¿hay un gato?», pero sí dar ejemplos.</figcaption>
</figure>
